# Commits

- Remote `origin` is `https://github.com/ahmedmsabry2000/grid-pulse.git`. Push is allowed for Spec → Issue → Project work (`scripts/github/`).
- Before every commit: run the stack locally ≥1 continuous minute and confirm healthy logs (no crash loops / error spam; WS/ticks flowing when applicable). Prefer `deployment/` compose (docker or podman); else local run scripts. Do not commit or open a PR until that smoke passes; note what ran + verdict in the PR body.
- Prefer Spec/Issue-linked branches (`cursor/<name>-b012`) and issue-scoped commit messages.
- Never force-push; never amend unless explicitly requested and conditions allow.
- Do not push secrets or local caches (`scripts/github/.cache/`).
